# Mosquitto password file template
#
# This file is NOT a valid passwd file. Copy these steps to create passwd:
#
#   cp config/passwd.example config/passwd   # optional marker file
#   mosquitto_passwd -c config/passwd publisher
#   mosquitto_passwd -b config/passwd subscriber your-secret
#
# Never commit config/passwd. Add topic rules in config/acl (from acl.example).

